 35MG cG $2013StZY observed this |g ray in the background-subtracted |g-ray     
 35MG2cG spectrum in a time window of 0-10 ms after the implantation of {+35}Na 
 35MG3cG but did not observe it in later time windows. 2013StZY proposed that it
 35MG4cG could either be the deexcitation of the first 2+ to 0+ g.s. in {+34}Mg 
 35MG5cG or the deexcitation of an excited state in {+35}Mg. Based on           
 35MG6cG theoretical calculations (2019Mo01,2021Mi17), the |b{+-}1n should be   
 35MG7cG the dominant branch, implying that this |g ray is more likely from     
 35MG8cG {+34}Mg.                                                               
                                                                                
