 35P 3c  MeV/nucleon on a 190 mg/cm{+2} Be target at GANIL. Decay observed with 
 35P 4c  a 1 mm thick plastic scintillator and a 174 cm{+3} intrinsic Ge        
 35P 5c  detector with 1.2% absolute efficiency at 1.33 MeV. Measured |b|g(t),  
 35P 6c  E|g, I|g. Deduced levels, J, |p, parent T{-1/2}.                       
 35P  c  2007Ne14: measured {+35}Si ground state magnetic moment and {Ig}-factor
 35P 2c  using the |b-NMR method.                                               
