 35CL3c  carbon and 5-mg/cm{+2} {+24}Mg. Deexcitation |g rays were detected     
 35CL4c  using two 40-cm{+3} Ge(Li) detectors at 125|' and at 0|' or 90|'.      
 35CL5c  Measured E|g, I|g, |g(|q) anisotropy, |g-ray yields. Deduced levels,   
 35CL6c  mixing ratio, transition strengths, T{-1/2} for 2 levels using the     
 35CL7c  Doppler Shift Attenuation Method (DSAM).                               
